    {
      "localId": 81,
      "createTime": 1762871359,
      "formattedTime": "2025-11-11 22:29:19",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "localType": 1,
      "content": "@所有人 \n各位小伙伴们，学姐的《战略咨询课程》内测课第一课 《行业认知：整体框架和逻辑》 已经正式上线啦！🎉\n\n🔹很多同学都问过学姐：\n\n“面试时遇到不熟悉的行业，我该怎么快速分析？”\n\n“怎样才能建立对某个行业的认知？是从读研报开始吗？”",
      "isSend": 0,
      "senderUsername": "wxid_gci3yscatvzm12",
      "senderDisplayName": "Kxuejie0818",
      "source": "<msgsource>\n\t<atuserlist>notify@all</atuserlist>\n\t<bizflag>0</bizflag>\n\t<pua>1</pua>\n\t<alnode>\n\t\t<inlenlist>50,65</inlenlist>\n\t</alnode>\n\t<eggIncluded>1</eggIncluded>\n\t<silence>1</silence>\n\t<membercount>342</membercount>\n\t<signature>N0_V1_GQc4cqEe|v1_LiPFWWRG</signature>\n\t<tmp_node>\n\t\t<publisher-id></publisher-id>\n\t</tmp_node>\n</msgsource>\n"
    },
    {
      "localId": 82,
      "createTime": 1762871389,
      "formattedTime": "2025-11-11 22:29:49",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "localType": 1,
      "content": "正因为大家对于提升行业认知的需求最强烈，所以学姐的课程直接带你解决四大核心问题\n\n1⃣面试中如何快速了解一个行业，思考逻辑是什么\n\n2⃣ 大量行业信息种，如何抓大放小，聚焦行业的研究重点\n\n3⃣理解行业研究的底层逻辑，不止是“怎么做”，更是“为什么这么做”\n\n4⃣在面试中，构建属于你自己的行业深度见解",
      "isSend": 0,
      "senderUsername": "wxid_gci3yscatvzm12",
      "senderDisplayName": "Kxuejie0818",
      "source": "<msgsource>\n\t<bizflag>0</bizflag>\n\t<pua>1</pua>\n\t<alnode>\n\t\t<inlenlist>39,110</inlenlist>\n\t</alnode>\n\t<eggIncluded>1</eggIncluded>\n\t<silence>1</silence>\n\t<membercount>342</membercount>\n\t<signature>N0_V1_EQHFCwnB|v1_vBErWyfP</signature>\n\t<tmp_node>\n\t\t<publisher-id></publisher-id>\n\t</tmp_node>\n</msgsource>\n"
    },
    {
      "localId": 83,
      "createTime": 1762871435,
      "formattedTime": "2025-11-11 22:30:35",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "localType": 1,
      "content": "🎈课程将以周更形式持续更新，体系化覆盖 【行业认知】【商业思维】【逻辑思维】【结构化PPT】 四大板块~\n\n带你从【行业认知→公司商业模式理解→运营问题解决→面试&职场表达 】 四大维度，建立对商业世界体系化的理解。",
      "isSend": 0,
      "senderUsername": "wxid_gci3yscatvzm12",
      "senderDisplayName": "Kxuejie0818",
      "source": "<msgsource>\n\t<bizflag>0</bizflag>\n\t<pua>1</pua>\n\t<alnode>\n\t\t<inlenlist>53,54</inlenlist>\n\t</alnode>\n\t<eggIncluded>1</eggIncluded>\n\t<silence>1</silence>\n\t<membercount>342</membercount>\n\t<signature>N0_V1_brtXQ1ZP|v1_AIm/6Rwd</signature>\n\t<tmp_node>\n\t\t<publisher-id></publisher-id>\n\t</tmp_node>\n</msgsource>\n"
    },
